WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.888
Logical and physical modeling,
following the data from HR to ICAM.

2
00:00:04.888 --> 00:00:09.052
In the middle is the logical model:
a person with an enterprise key the

3
00:00:09.052 --> 00:00:13.800
agency controls — their assignments, and
the lifecycle events that change them.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.229
On the left, the OPM element
that feeds each field;

5
00:00:17.229 --> 00:00:22.031
then where it lands in Entra ID and
Active Directory; and on the right,

6
00:00:22.031 --> 00:00:27.432
what ICAM does with it — component scope,
location policy, role-based access,

7
00:00:27.432 --> 00:00:32.062
approvals, and the joiner, mover
and leaver actions, including PIV.

8
00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:37.673
Three physical rules: native attributes
first; codes, never display strings, in

9
00:00:37.673 --> 00:00:39.744
anything that grants access;

10
00:00:39.744 --> 00:00:44.274
and one governed crosswalk as
the only place mappings live.
